<p>Your hiemal shield is stronger, taking <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">8%, 13%, 17%, 19%, 22%</acronym> less damage from all attacks.</p><p>When under 1 life this effect is increased to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10%, 17%, 22%, 26%, 29%.</acronym></p>